      ],
      "text": "Table 1.3  lists the comparisons and decisions on each of the sub-PICO-questions that were eventually",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.9707612991333,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4442138671875,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "used by the GDG to conclude with this summary recommendation. Throughout the discussion, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.2199096679688,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "GDG panel focused on direct (within trial) comparisons among the TB-PRACTECAL trial arms, to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4111938476562,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "ensure consistency and because it was felt that results based on random allocation to interventions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.2293090820312,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "were far more reliable than indirect, nonrandomized comparisons. Whereas the certainty of evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988043785095215,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4410400390625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "of these (TB-PRACTECAL-internal) comparisons was still judged to be very low, the panel deemed it",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        443.53729248046875,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "to be higher than that of other (indirect or between-trial or cohort) comparisons.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.2573852539062,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "Although assessments of PICO questions 3, 4, 5 and 6 have all contributed to the summary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.2890625,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "recommendation, the main assessment that defined the overall decision was that of sub-PICO 6.1 on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9941987991333,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.6019897460938,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "the comparison of the BPaLM regimen of the stage 2 (corresponds to Phase 3) in the TB-PRACTECAL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991896629333496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.2009887695312,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "trial with the mix of SoC regimens (conforming to the WHO-recommended 9-month or longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4232177734375,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "regimens). Even though the TB-PRACTECAL trial was not designed to compare the investigational",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4091796875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "regimens against each other and with the SoC, the comparisons of the different arms of the trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.4276733398438,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "with the BPaLM arm (sub-PICOs 6.2–6.6) were performed to aid the panel in making final decisions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4345092773438,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "The assessment of PICO 3 allowed for the decision on the optimal dosing and duration of linezolid",
