      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.1007690429688,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "within the BPaLM/BPaL regimen and narrowed down the subsequent comparisons to the intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97562313079834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.3539428710938,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "regimen with this particular dose and duration of linezolid – BPaL (600 mg – 26 weeks). The justification",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953853607177734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4034423828125,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "for how the other assessments have contributed to the overall recommendation can be summarized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        120.64108276367188,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "as follows:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7025146484375,
        527.3831176757812,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "a)\t The assessment of PICO 4 resulted in the conditional recommendation for use of BPaL (600 mg –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.5159912109375,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "26 weeks) regimen over the currently recommended longer regimens in patients with MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977327346801758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        282.0699462890625,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "and additional fluoroquinolone resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.55450439453125,
        527.1766967773438,
        401.9975280761719
      ],
      "text": "b)\t  The three assessments performed under PICO 5 resulted in the conditional recommendations for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        400.7545166015625,
        527.447998046875,
        415.1975402832031
      ],
      "text": "the BPaL (600 mg – 26 weeks) regimen over the currently recommended 9-month regimen with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        413.9544982910156,
        527.4151611328125,
        428.39752197265625
      ],
      "text": "ethionamide (sub-PICO 5.1), over longer regimens (sub-PICO 5.2) and over the new 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        427.1545104980469,
        527.5867309570312,
        441.5975341796875
      ],
      "text": "regimen where ethionamide is replaced with 2 months of linezolid (sub-PICO 5.3) in patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997900009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        440.3544921875,
        361.5240173339844,
        454.7975158691406
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary MDR/RR-TB without fluoroquinolone resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.8065185546875,
        527.166015625,
        472.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "c)\t  The assessment of sub-PICO 6.1 resulted in the conditional recommendation for use of the BPaLM",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        471.0065002441406,
        527.4305419921875,
        485.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "regimen of the TB-PRACTECAL trial over the comparator, the mix of SoC regimens under this",
