      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        484.2065124511719,
        527.3798828125,
        498.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "trial conforming to the WHO recommendations on 9-month or longer regimens, depending on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        497.406494140625,
        145.2430877685547,
        511.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "the trial site.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.8585205078125,
        527.5853271484375,
        529.301513671875
      ],
      "text": "d)\t  The assessments of sub-PICOs 6.4 and 6.6 resulted in the conditional recommendations for BPaLC",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        528.0584716796875,
        527.3897094726562,
        542.50146484375
      ],
      "text": "and BPaL over the SoC in the TB-PRACTECAL trial; thus all three 6-month BPaL-based regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        541.2584228515625,
        433.9635314941406,
        555.701416015625
      ],
      "text": "were assessed to be preferred over the mix of SoC regimens under this trial.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.71044921875,
        527.4606323242188,
        573.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "e)\t  The assessments of sub-PICOs 6.3 and 6.5 resulted in the conditional recommendations for BPaLM",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        571.9105224609375,
        527.3831176757812,
        586.353515625
      ],
      "text": "and BPaL over BPaLC; based on these assessments the GDG concluded that BPaLC should not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        585.1104125976562,
        233.49172973632812,
        599.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "be recommended as a regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        602.5623779296875,
        527.391845703125,
        617.00537109375
      ],
      "text": "f)\t The assessment of sub-PICO 6.2 resulted in the conditional recommendations for BPaLM over",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        615.7623901367188,
        527.5755004882812,
        630.2053833007812
      ],
      "text": "BPaL; thus, it highlighted the use of the BPaLM regimen as the preferred regimen under the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        628.96240234375,
        527.4194946289062,
        643.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "conditions specified in the recommendation and remarks. Compared with BPaL, BPaLM led to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        642.1624145507812,
        527.4437866210938,
        656.6054077148438
      ],
      "text": "more treatment success, fewer failures or recurrences and less emerging drug resistance while",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        655.3624267578125,
        231.4611053466797,
        669.805419921875
      ],
      "text": "showing little difference in AEs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
